# Homonym-adjudication artifacts (id:e977). tracker/homonym-worksheet.sh writes these
# OUTSIDE any repo by default and refuses an in-repo --outdir without --force-in-repo;
# this is the belt-and-braces for the override. They quote item TITLES from ~49 mostly
# PRIVATE repos and this repo is PUBLIC — the script is the artifact, the output is not.
homonym-worksheet.md
homonym-allowlist.draft.txt
fleet.json

# Handover docs are LOCAL-ONLY (owner ruling 2026-09-08, /relay human).
# They are working notes for the next session and they quote fleet internals from
# mostly PRIVATE sibling repos -- item ids, ledger sizes, internal tool names and
# their known bugs -- while this repo is PUBLIC. HANDOVER-2026-09-05-1301.md was the
# worst case: it tabulated the exact tokens a censor was meant to remove, which made
# the rest findable. The 26 already-published ones stay in history (retraction is
# id:d29b half (b), still open); this rule stops any further ones being published.
docs/HANDOVER-*.md
